><br /> Read it, but I do not understand it - maybe my English is failing me. It's about that Seo Hell did not have proper gender, only being 'it', yes?</div> </div> </div> </div>That, and the obvious relation with Satan, and the possible allusions to a Legacy of Reapers that got absorbed into the Tremere if you want crossover.<br /> <br /> With abilities like Luna's Embrace, gender and sex are hardly issues to the Uratha.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-10T04:18:28-07:00","id":1090674,"title":"","content":"Well Hati and <i>Sk\u00f6ll want to eat the Sun and Moon, that is a lot of Wolfy doomsday to bring up. Perhaps these Balehounds believe they can become gods of the Apocalypse, and even Maeljin themselves if they can bring about eternal darkness? Garm too could work, as a guardian of the Gate of Hel, and slayer of Tyr. Maybe you can invoke the Releasing of Garm as some sort of Necromantic releasing of the Dead to the land of the living? And eating a God?</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-10T04:56:50-07:00","id":1090677,"title":"","content":"I think about using sex changing female Irraka from ex Bone Shadows that really thinks she is now Hel, Daughter of Loki. Irraka are pointed as having relation to Loki and Bone Shadows have affinity to Hel. Twisting it up, we end with spirit driven lone stalker-priests that want to consume everything in Sundering of Men - Ragnarok! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-05-2018, 07:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}